WEBVTT

00:00:24.810 --> 00:00:27.310
"Wednesday, June 15th"

00:02:43.410 --> 00:02:47.040
"Higurashi: When They Cry SOTSU"

00:02:47.040 --> 00:02:49.540
"Thursday, June 16th"

00:02:52.540 --> 00:02:56.760
Why are you both chasing me?! Why?!

00:02:58.420 --> 00:03:02.050
Because those thighs of yours
look so delicious!

00:03:02.050 --> 00:03:05.260
You'll make for
a scrumptious dinner tonight!

00:03:05.260 --> 00:03:10.770
I call dibs on your juicy, meaty arms!

00:03:10.770 --> 00:03:14.980
Stay back! Don't eat me!

00:03:17.070 --> 00:03:19.110
I should be okay now, I think...

00:03:19.740 --> 00:03:21.410
Rika-chan...

00:03:24.620 --> 00:03:26.030
You're still safe?

00:03:26.030 --> 00:03:28.290
I'm giving it my all!

00:03:28.290 --> 00:03:30.710
Satoko-chan and Mii-chan
chased after me...

00:03:30.710 --> 00:03:32.830
Don't worry, Rena.

00:03:32.830 --> 00:03:34.840
Thank goodness...

00:03:35.500 --> 00:03:38.550
Rika-chan? What're you doing?

00:03:40.010 --> 00:03:44.050
Wait, why are you coming closer? Why?!

00:03:44.050 --> 00:03:47.560
Don't be afraid, Rena. I'll be gentle.

00:03:47.560 --> 00:03:49.140
Gentle?

00:03:49.140 --> 00:03:51.310
When I eat you alive!

00:03:52.980 --> 00:03:57.230
Y-You're joking, right?! You wouldn't...

00:04:00.070 --> 00:04:03.490
Keiichi-kun! Help!

00:04:09.330 --> 00:04:13.330
Well, <i>that </i>was intense.

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:23.800
Never knew Rena had the guts
to get someone killed.

00:04:28.760 --> 00:04:31.100
Frickin' Mion...

00:04:37.610 --> 00:04:39.070
Here.

00:04:39.070 --> 00:04:41.280
O-Oh, sure. Thanks.

00:04:56.290 --> 00:04:58.340
I have to work harder.

00:04:58.340 --> 00:05:00.800
Much...

00:05:00.800 --> 00:05:02.420
...much, much,

00:05:02.420 --> 00:05:05.680
much, much, much harder!

00:05:08.470 --> 00:05:11.060
I've gotta work so much harder!

00:05:12.270 --> 00:05:14.770
"Friday, June 17th"

00:05:15.270 --> 00:05:16.400
We've got big plans this year!

00:05:16.400 --> 00:05:19.770
The hallmark of our club,
the Watanagashi Four-Demon Battle Royale!

00:05:19.770 --> 00:05:21.440
What kind of name is that?

00:05:21.440 --> 00:05:25.860
Though I guess it'll be a Five-Demon
Battle Royale with Keiichi joining us.

00:05:27.110 --> 00:05:31.830
You'll have the sublime opportunity
to demonstrate all you've learned with us!

00:05:31.830 --> 00:05:37.250
Which means we'll be going around the
festival stalls and playing club games.

00:05:37.250 --> 00:05:39.460
Is that it?

00:05:39.460 --> 00:05:41.800
Well, now I'm getting
kinda excited for it!

00:05:58.560 --> 00:06:00.940
There!

00:06:00.940 --> 00:06:02.980
Now everything will be okay!

00:06:02.980 --> 00:06:05.240
Nobody knows she's here,
not even the police!

00:06:05.240 --> 00:06:06.400
Nobody...

00:06:06.400 --> 00:06:09.240
Yo, Rena! Working up a sweat?

00:06:11.240 --> 00:06:14.700
I've worked so hard,
but it's still not enough.

00:06:14.700 --> 00:06:20.250
Or is our family still being punished...

00:06:20.250 --> 00:06:24.380
...for breaking the rules
and leaving Hinamizawa?

00:06:27.300 --> 00:06:31.430
Please. Please, I'm begging you.

00:06:31.430 --> 00:06:34.680
Tell me how much longer
this curse will last.

00:06:34.680 --> 00:06:36.390
Please...

00:06:36.390 --> 00:06:39.980
Please forgive me, Oyashiro-sama!

00:06:40.190 --> 00:06:42.690
"Sunday, June 19th"

00:06:48.400 --> 00:06:51.240
Hey there, kids. You look like
you're having a good time.

00:06:51.240 --> 00:06:53.370
Good evening, though I must say!

00:06:53.370 --> 00:06:55.410
Photographing a lady without permission

00:06:55.410 --> 00:06:58.210
is quite the breach of etiquette!

00:06:58.210 --> 00:07:01.170
That's right, though I don't know
why he'd need <i>your </i>permiss--

00:08:39.470 --> 00:08:40.930
Who's Oyashiro-sama?

00:08:40.930 --> 00:08:43.270
It's the guardian deity of Hinamizawa.

00:08:43.270 --> 00:08:46.230
That's why it's really important
to pay your respects to it.

00:08:47.310 --> 00:08:49.320
Thank you, Oyashiro-sama.

00:08:49.530 --> 00:08:52.190
Thank you, Oyashiro-sama.

00:08:52.190 --> 00:08:54.030
Oyashiro-sama...

00:08:55.030 --> 00:08:57.320
Thank you, Oyashiro-sama.

00:09:14.800 --> 00:09:18.140
How far did she go to find everyone?

00:09:28.980 --> 00:09:34.490
Which is it? Did Keiichi-kun see, or not?

00:09:34.490 --> 00:09:37.910
Did he or didn't he?

00:09:39.160 --> 00:09:41.660
"Monday, June 20th"

00:09:41.660 --> 00:09:43.910
"Bathrooms"

00:09:44.660 --> 00:09:46.620
Maebara-kun!

00:09:46.620 --> 00:09:48.710
Chie-sensei? What is it?

00:09:48.710 --> 00:09:52.210
A visitor is here to see you
at the school entrance.

00:09:52.210 --> 00:09:53.920
A visitor? For me?

00:09:57.470 --> 00:10:02.930
I know that man walking with Keiichi-kun.

00:10:05.430 --> 00:10:10.940
Why is Keiichi-kun talking
with a policeman?

00:10:10.940 --> 00:10:13.280
Why? Why?

00:10:13.280 --> 00:10:15.070
<i>Why?!</i>

00:10:15.070 --> 00:10:18.950
Oh, there you are!

00:10:18.950 --> 00:10:22.330
My goodness! I cannot find
Keiichi-san anywhere!

00:10:22.330 --> 00:10:26.040
Come, Rena-san! It's time for club!

00:10:26.040 --> 00:10:30.920
Today, we're playing a card guessing game
where you try to find the murderer!

00:10:30.920 --> 00:10:34.960
O-Okay, I'll be there in a sec.

00:10:34.960 --> 00:10:38.680
What's wrong with your neck?

00:10:38.680 --> 00:10:40.510
H-Huh?

00:10:40.510 --> 00:10:46.100
Oh, I don't know.
It's just been really itchy lately.

00:10:46.100 --> 00:10:49.600
My, I do hope you feel better soon!

00:10:49.600 --> 00:10:51.480
Thanks, Satoko-chan.

00:11:04.120 --> 00:11:09.460
You guys aren't lying to me or
hiding stuff from me, right?

00:11:09.460 --> 00:11:12.630
Huh? Of course not!

00:11:12.630 --> 00:11:13.880
That's not true.

00:11:13.880 --> 00:11:16.000
What do you mean, Keiichi-kun?

00:11:16.000 --> 00:11:18.130
I know you're hiding stuff from me!

00:11:18.130 --> 00:11:20.220
Okay, Keiichi-kun.

00:11:20.220 --> 00:11:24.560
Then are you lying about anything
or hiding anything from me?

00:11:24.560 --> 00:11:25.560
Huh?

00:11:25.560 --> 00:11:29.640
You're not lying or hiding anything,
right? You're not, right?

00:11:29.640 --> 00:11:32.350
I'm not lying or hiding anything from you.

00:11:32.350 --> 00:11:34.650
--You're lying.
--Why do you think I'm lying?

00:11:34.650 --> 00:11:36.150
I know what you did.

00:11:36.150 --> 00:11:39.860
You hid something from me
at the trash heap, right?

00:11:39.860 --> 00:11:42.910
--No, I...
--When you skipped club,

00:11:42.910 --> 00:11:45.200
you didn't <i>really </i>go to the teacher's office.

00:11:45.200 --> 00:11:50.660
--How do you--
--You were talking with an older man in his car.

00:11:50.660 --> 00:11:52.460
Who was he?

00:11:52.460 --> 00:11:54.170
I-I don't know who he was.

00:11:54.170 --> 00:11:57.170
Why would a stranger want
to talk to you, Keiichi-kun?

00:11:57.170 --> 00:11:58.760
I-I don't know, either!

00:11:58.760 --> 00:12:00.880
Well, what did you talk about?

00:12:00.880 --> 00:12:02.510
Nothing to do with any of you--

00:12:02.510 --> 00:12:03.800
You're lying!

00:12:10.310 --> 00:12:12.100
Keiichi!

00:12:13.650 --> 00:12:16.230
You've got a call from the bookstore.

00:12:16.230 --> 00:12:17.940
The bookstore?

00:12:17.940 --> 00:12:19.820
Hey there, Rena-chan!

00:12:19.820 --> 00:12:21.820
Good evening!

00:12:21.820 --> 00:12:27.410
Come on in, don't be shy.
Keiichi's up in his room.

00:12:27.410 --> 00:12:28.790
Okay!

00:12:28.790 --> 00:12:32.920
Do you know where it is?
It's just up the stairs.

00:12:32.920 --> 00:12:34.460
Thank you, sir!

00:12:36.380 --> 00:12:40.880
Oh, wait! I've got some snacks
you can munch on.

00:12:40.880 --> 00:12:43.220
I'll bring them up to you in a minute.

00:12:43.220 --> 00:12:44.930
Yay, snacks!

00:12:46.430 --> 00:12:48.220
You two have fun.

00:12:48.220 --> 00:12:49.680
We will!

00:13:04.400 --> 00:13:07.320
Tell me, Ooishi-san!

00:13:08.450 --> 00:13:10.120
I want to hear it.

00:13:12.370 --> 00:13:15.290
Yeah, I know she'd only just moved here.

00:13:18.130 --> 00:13:19.670
Rena really did that?!

00:13:38.980 --> 00:13:41.400
Keiichi-kun was on the phone...

00:13:41.400 --> 00:13:43.780
...with that detective!

00:13:43.780 --> 00:13:46.660
And he was <i>talking </i>about me!

00:13:53.250 --> 00:13:56.960
Don't worry, Dad.

00:13:56.960 --> 00:13:59.420
I just need to work...

00:13:59.420 --> 00:14:01.460
...a little bit harder.

00:14:06.970 --> 00:14:08.800
I'm home.

00:14:08.800 --> 00:14:12.390
Hey, there you are, Reina.

00:14:12.390 --> 00:14:14.850
Did you eat lunch?

00:14:15.770 --> 00:14:18.400
I wasn't that hungry.

00:14:18.400 --> 00:14:20.110
Are you okay?

00:14:20.110 --> 00:14:21.610
It's Rina-san.

00:14:21.610 --> 00:14:24.360
I haven't been able
to get in contact with her,

00:14:24.360 --> 00:14:27.530
and she hasn't shown up
to work at all, either.

00:14:27.530 --> 00:14:30.160
Oh. I hope she's okay.

00:14:32.370 --> 00:14:35.370
I'll get it. You relax.

00:14:35.370 --> 00:14:36.870
Thanks.

00:14:38.870 --> 00:14:40.880
Hi there, Rena-chan?

00:14:40.880 --> 00:14:42.540
Keiichi-kun's mom?

00:14:42.540 --> 00:14:46.800
Yes, that's right. I have a favor
to ask you, if that's all right.

00:14:46.800 --> 00:14:49.430
Is it something for Keiichi-kun?

00:14:49.430 --> 00:14:54.010
Yes. I had to go into the city for work,
and I won't be home until tomorrow.

00:14:54.010 --> 00:14:56.640
Keiichi's home alone right now.

00:14:56.640 --> 00:14:57.890
What about his dad?

00:14:57.890 --> 00:15:01.310
He had to come with me, too.

00:15:01.310 --> 00:15:05.190
I hate to spring this on you
like this, Rena-chan...

00:15:05.190 --> 00:15:10.820
Don't worry, ma'am.
I'll make dinner for Keiichi-kun.

00:15:10.820 --> 00:15:12.740
Thank you so much, Rena-chan!

00:15:12.740 --> 00:15:17.500
Feel free to use anything
you need in the kitchen or fridge.

00:15:30.090 --> 00:15:32.850
Huh? You're heading out?

00:15:32.850 --> 00:15:35.060
Yeah, I'm going to Keiichi-kun's.

00:15:35.060 --> 00:15:38.390
Sorry. Dinner might be a little late.

00:15:38.390 --> 00:15:40.600
Oh, that's okay.

00:15:40.600 --> 00:15:43.110
Stay safe, Reina.

00:15:43.110 --> 00:15:44.110
I will!

00:15:44.110 --> 00:15:46.230
I'm gonna go work really hard.

00:16:07.380 --> 00:16:10.420
Keiichi-kun! Let me in, Keiichi-kun!

00:16:10.420 --> 00:16:12.220
R-Rena?

00:16:12.220 --> 00:16:15.300
Your mom called me, Keiichi-kun.

00:16:15.300 --> 00:16:18.060
She told me to bring you dinner.

00:16:18.060 --> 00:16:22.190
R-Really? That's news to me...

00:16:23.350 --> 00:16:27.820
I made a lot so we could eat
dinner together, Keiichi-kun.

00:16:27.820 --> 00:16:30.860
C'mon, open up. Let me in.

00:16:30.860 --> 00:16:35.160
Why are you being so mean to me? Why?

00:16:36.580 --> 00:16:39.160
Are you afraid of Rena?

00:16:39.160 --> 00:16:40.500
I know it sounds weird.

00:16:40.500 --> 00:16:46.130
She's my friend, and I care
about her a lot, but I just...

00:16:46.130 --> 00:16:49.880
Sometimes, when she looks at me,
her eyes look so creepy...

00:16:49.880 --> 00:16:51.970
It just freaks me out.

00:16:51.970 --> 00:16:53.590
--You're lying.
--Huh?!

00:16:53.590 --> 00:16:58.430
If she said that to you,
it should've been a one-time thing.

00:16:59.350 --> 00:17:03.020
Maybe you were just a little tired
when she said that.

00:17:03.020 --> 00:17:06.940
Or maybe you're just making
a mountain out of a molehill.

00:17:06.940 --> 00:17:12.070
Maybe, when you feel afraid of Rena,

00:17:12.070 --> 00:17:16.320
you shouldn't doubt Rena, but yourself.

00:17:20.620 --> 00:17:22.160
I'm...

00:17:36.090 --> 00:17:40.680
A-Are you that hungry?! Are you?!

00:17:56.820 --> 00:17:59.660
Everything should be okay now.

00:18:03.830 --> 00:18:06.120
I know you can win, Keiichi!

00:18:09.380 --> 00:18:11.750
Chin up, okay?

00:18:33.730 --> 00:18:36.240
"Friday, June 24th"

00:18:39.490 --> 00:18:42.580
Good morning!

00:18:42.580 --> 00:18:44.450
Morning.

00:18:44.450 --> 00:18:47.500
Good morning!

00:18:47.500 --> 00:18:50.000
Mii, where are Keiichi and Rena?

00:18:50.000 --> 00:18:52.920
Good morning, class.

00:18:52.920 --> 00:18:56.630
I know it's a bit early,
but could you please take your seats?

00:18:56.630 --> 00:18:59.010
I have an important announcement to make.

00:18:59.010 --> 00:19:01.010
Whatever could it be?

00:19:01.010 --> 00:19:04.720
It can't be. It can't.

00:19:04.720 --> 00:19:07.770
Let's listen now, okay?

00:19:07.770 --> 00:19:10.270
Last night...

00:19:10.270 --> 00:19:15.530
Maebara-kun and Ryugu-san
were found injured and unconscious.

00:19:15.530 --> 00:19:19.950
Maebara-kun is still in the hospital.

00:19:19.950 --> 00:19:22.490
Unfortunately, Ryugu-san...

00:19:22.490 --> 00:19:23.830
You're lying!

00:19:30.120 --> 00:19:32.840
I know, Rika-chan.

00:19:32.840 --> 00:19:36.050
When the police called
to tell us what happened,

00:19:36.050 --> 00:19:38.380
I couldn't believe it, either.

00:19:38.380 --> 00:19:40.220
Rika?

00:19:40.220 --> 00:19:42.340
Furude-san, please sit down.

00:19:42.340 --> 00:19:45.060
I'm not done with my announcement.

00:19:45.060 --> 00:19:49.060
You aren't? Well, I'm done.

00:19:52.150 --> 00:19:55.440
I'll go check on her later.

00:19:56.440 --> 00:19:58.820
Thank you, Hojo-san.

00:20:05.410 --> 00:20:08.410
"DO NOT ENTER"

00:20:15.840 --> 00:20:21.430
"Furude Shrine"

00:21:21.240 --> 00:21:24.150
I'm home, Rika.

00:21:35.250 --> 00:21:38.090
You're quite dead, I see.

00:21:38.090 --> 00:21:43.800
You know, if I die before you do,
I can't chase after you.

00:21:46.800 --> 00:21:50.350
Rika, I'm sure you think
this was all a case of bad luck.

00:21:50.350 --> 00:21:54.020
That you'll be able to escape
the tragedy on the next fragment.

00:21:54.020 --> 00:21:56.270
That's what you're hoping, yes?

00:21:56.270 --> 00:21:58.310
Now, that won't do.

00:21:58.310 --> 00:22:00.230
Until you finally give up...

00:22:00.230 --> 00:22:05.450
...you will never, ever, <i>ever</i>...

00:22:05.450 --> 00:22:08.200
...escape Oyashiro-sama's curse.

00:23:45.960 --> 00:23:49.970
"<i>Wataakashi-hen</i>:
Cotton-Revealing Chapter, Part 1"

00:23:45.960 --> 00:23:49.970
Next time: "<i>Wataakashi-hen</i>:
Cotton-Revealing Chapter, Part 1.
